ge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 第三纪元是持久协作者，产品周期只有三个月 OpenAI 产品负责人 Tara Seshan 断言，AI 产品正从聊天、代理走向持久协作者，构建必须按两到三个月的模型能力设计；未来工作是掌舵而非划桨，写作即思考永不上自动化。 Lenny&#x27;s Podcast Lenny&#x27;s Podcast AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) 产品周期 持久协作者 Codex 写作即思考 产品营销契合 persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三纪元是持久协作者-产品周期只有三个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三纪元是持久协作者，产品周期只有三个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 产品负责人 Tara Seshan 断言，AI 产品正从聊天、代理走向持久协作者，构建必须按两到三个月的模型能力设计；未来工作是掌舵而非划桨，写作即思考永不上自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品周期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久协作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI 盈利是泡沫：成本后置，利润前置 AI 基建的利润当下兑现，成本却摊销到未来，这构成盈利泡沫。股市会先于盈利见顶，投资者应警惕而非追逐。 Excess Returns Excess Returns The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble AI泡沫 盈利质量 杠杆ETF 黄金 贸易政策 Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本后置-利润前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</sp